# Dev reminder

Read [`docs/DEV_REMINDER.md`](docs/DEV_REMINDER.md) before planning. Confirm with the user before writing code.

## Dialog contrast (do not re-break)

`.confirm-dialog` is solid `#fff` with `#111` text (nested glass + Windows native chrome are light; `--text-primary` is light). Unclassed Cancel in `.confirm-dialog__actions` stays `#111`. Do not restore themed light text on that shell. Do not blanket-recolor every `<select>` (dark `--input-bg` would invert).

## Dates / layout

Dates: `yyyy-mm-dd`. Compact vs Focus as in `.cursorrules`. No decorative corner brackets.
